-w\" lang=\"ja\">サイン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">签名；亲笔签名；标志；信号；迹象</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">境</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">边界；界限；转折点；分水岭；地区；区域；场所；空间；环境；心理状态；精神状态；认知对象；感官或心智所能感知的事物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103205\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>生死<rp>(</rp><rt>せいし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>境<rp>(</rp><rt>さかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をさ<ruby>迷<rp>(</rp><rt>まよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他失去了生命死亡的界限。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逆らう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さからう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">违抗；反抗；违逆；不服从</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103432\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>風潮<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>逆<rp>(</rp><rt>さか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他反对世界的风潮。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span cla