=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纸币；钞票；纸钞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さて</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">好吧；那么；现在</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂漠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さばく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沙漠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192650\">ラクダは、いわば<ruby>砂漠<rp>(</rp><rt>さばく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">骆驼，这么说吧，也就是沙漠中的船。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/512804\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">差別</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さべつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">区别；区分；差别；歧视；不公正对待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144387\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>人種<rp>(</rp><rt>じんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>差別<rp>(</rp><rt>さべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのは<ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">种族歧视是错误的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vro