rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>皿<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她把盘子放在桌子上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">更に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さらに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">而且；再者；况且；愈加；越来越；更加</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209257\">その<ruby>小説<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>名声<rp>(</rp><rt>めいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>更<rp>(</rp><rt>さら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这部小说增加了他的名声。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">去る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">离去；离开；走开；经过；消逝；流逝；远离；距离远；驱赶；赶走；休弃；彻底地；完全地；上一个；前一个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174604\"><ruby>古<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>時代<rp>(</rp><rt>じだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>去<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って、<ruby>二度<rp>(</rp><rt>にど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ともどってこない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">古老的好时代已经过去了,再也不会回来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">猿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">猴子（尤指日本猕猴）；猿；（人以外的）灵长类动物；狡猾的人；笨蛋；乡巴佬；木插销；门闩（用于固定门窗的滑动木栓）；（调节吊锅钩高度的）卡扣；澡堂妓女</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109569\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>猿<rp>(</rp><rt>さる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のように<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によじ<ruby>登<rp>(</rp><rt>のぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他像猴子一样爬在树上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">騒ぎ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さわぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">骚动；喧闹；纷乱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220705\">この<ruby>騒<rp>(</rp><rt>さわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎはどうしたの。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个混乱发生了什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">参加</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さんか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">参加；参与；加入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232117\">あなたは<ruby>競技<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>参加<rp>(</rp><rt>さんか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你参加了比赛吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">参考</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さんこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">参